        <mxCell id="context-note" value="Question: who uses shift swaps, and which systems does it depend on? Scope is this one product; each external system is an integration in build-spec.md Integrations and data (I1 to I3), and each person is an actor from the stakeholder map.&lt;br&gt;The roster system stays the system of record for shifts. Shift swaps never edits a shift except through I1.&lt;br&gt;Proposed. It does not test that the integrations exist, perform, or allow these uses." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="870" width="1180" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
